# Line endings
#
# Every text file is stored with LF and checked out with LF. The workspace runs
# on Windows, but the container, any CI and most editors on the team do not:
# without this, the same file shows up as modified when only the line ending
# changed, and review diffs fill with noise that hides the real change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: git must never normalise these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
